     2	"""Hornhoof relay: hands out <name>.hornhoof.org links and checks every tunnel that frps lets in.
     3	
     4	Public API (Caddy sends https://hornhoof.org/api/* here):
     5	  GET    /api/v1/names/{name}      -> 200 {name, free, reason?: taken|reserved|invalid}
     6	  POST   /api/v1/bindings          {name?} -> 201 {name, url, key, tunnel}
     7	  DELETE /api/v1/bindings/{name}   Authorization: Bearer <key> -> 204
     8	  GET    /api/v1/links/{name}/route Authorization: Bearer <key> -> 200 {state, client, since, generation, ...}
     9	  GET    /api/v1/health            -> 200 {ok, frps, relayStarted} while frps takes logins, else 503
    10	frps plugin (local only): POST /frp/handler?op=Login|NewProxy|Ping
    11	Admin (as the service user): relay.py admin list|show|ban|unban|release|banned-caddy ...
